dsh-tokeneconomizer
===================

This project is an independent TypeScript implementation of three mechanisms
from TokenEconomizer:

    https://github.com/microsoft/TokenEconomizer
    arXiv:2610.22732
    Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation and contributors
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0

The mechanism designs, the lifecycle and firing-gate constants (K_PROMOTE,
GAMMA, LAMBDA, FIRE_GATE, FIRE_MIN_N), the price-ratio model of the cost
accounting, and the envfact extraction families are derived from that project.
The implementation here is new: it targets the DeepSeek Harness plugin API
(Cordis) rather than the out-of-process hooks TokenEconomizer uses for Claude
Code, Codex and Copilot CLI.

Files derived in substance from TokenEconomizer are marked in their module
docstrings. No source file was copied verbatim.

